msgid "Introduction to Molpro"
msgstr "Molpro 简介"

msgid ""
"Molpro is a complete system of *ab initio* programs for molecular electronic"
" structure calculations, designed and maintained by H.-J. Werner and P. J. "
"Knowles, and containing contributions from a number of other authors. As "
"distinct from other commonly used quantum chemistry packages, the emphasis "
"is on highly accurate computations, with extensive treatment of the electron"
" correlation problem through the multiconfiguration-reference CI, coupled "
"cluster and associated methods. The recently developed explicitly correlated"
" coupled-cluster methods yield CCSD(T) results with near basis set limit "
"accuracy already with double\\ :math:`-\\zeta` or triple\\ :math:`-\\zeta` "
"basis sets, thus reducing the computational effort for calculations of this "
"quality by two orders of magnitude. Using local electron correlation "
"methods, which significantly reduce the increase of the computational cost "
"with molecular size, accurate *ab initio* calculations can be performed for "
"much larger molecules than with most other programs. These methods have "
"recently been augmented by explicitly correlated terms, which strongly "
"reduce both the basis set truncation errors and the errors of the local "
"approximations."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 是一个用于分子电子结构计算的完整\\ *从头计算*\\ 程序系统，由 H.-J. Werner 和 P. J. Knowles "
"设计并维护，并包含了许多其他作者的贡献。与其他常用的量子化学软件包不同，其重点在于高精度计算，通过多参考组态相互作用、耦合簇及相关方法对电子相关问题进行广泛处理。最近开发的显式相关耦合簇方法，仅使用双\\"
" :math:`-\\zeta` 或三\\ :math:`-\\zeta` 基组即可获得接近基组极限精度的 CCSD(T) "
"结果，从而将此类质量计算的计算量降低了两个数量级。使用局域电子关联方法（该方法显著降低了计算成本随分子尺寸的增长），可以对比大多数其他程序大得多的分子进行精确的\\"
" *从头计算*\\ 。这些方法最近已通过显式相关项得到增强，这些项极大地减少了基组截断误差和局域近似的误差。"

msgid ""
"The heart of the program consists of the multiconfiguration SCF, "
"multireference CI, and coupled-cluster routines, and these are accompanied "
"by a full set of supporting features. The package comprises"
msgstr "程序的核心包括多组态 SCF、多参考 CI 和耦合簇例程，并辅以一套完整的支持功能。该软件包包含"

msgid ""
"Integral generation for generally contracted symmetry adapted gaussian basis"
" functions (:math:`spdfghi`). There are two programs with identical "
"functionality: the preferred code is ``Seward`` (R. Lindh) which is the best"
" on most machines; ``Argos`` (R. M. Pitzer) is available as an alternative, "
"and in some cases is optimum for small memory scalar machines. Also two "
"different gradient integral codes, namely ``Cadpac`` (R. Amos) and "
"``Alaska`` (R. Lindh) are available. Only the latter allows the use of "
"generally contracted symmetry adapted gaussian basis functions."
msgstr ""
"用于广义收缩对称性匹配高斯基函数 (:math:`spdfghi`) 的积分生成。有两个功能相同的程序：首选代码是 ``Seward`` (R. "
"Lindh)，它在大多数机器上表现最佳；\\ ``Argos`` (R. M. Pitzer) "
"作为替代方案可用，在某些情况下对于小内存标量机器是最优的。此外，还有两个不同的梯度积分代码，即 ``Cadpac`` (R. Amos) 和 "
"``Alaska`` (R. Lindh)。只有后者允许使用广义收缩对称性匹配高斯基函数。"

msgid "Effective Core Potentials (contributions from H. Stoll)."
msgstr "有效芯势（H. Stoll 的贡献）。"

msgid "Many one-electron properties."
msgstr "许多单电子性质。"

msgid ""
"Some two-electron properties, e.g. :math:`L_x^2`, :math:`L_y^2`, "
":math:`L_z^2`, :math:`L_xL_y` etc.."
msgstr ""
"一些双电子性质，例如 :math:`L_x^2`\\ 、\\ :math:`L_y^2`\\ 、\\ :math:`L_z^2`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`L_xL_y` 等。"

msgid ""
"Closed-shell and open-shell (spin restricted and unrestricted) self "
"consistent field."
msgstr "闭壳层和开壳层（自旋限制和非限制）自洽场。"

msgid ""
"Density-functional theory in the Kohn-Sham framework with various gradient "
"corrected exchange and correlation potentials."
msgstr "Kohn-Sham框架下的密度泛函理论，包含各种梯度修正的交换与关联势。"

msgid ""
"Multiconfiguration self consistent field. This is the quadratically "
"convergent MCSCF procedure described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.448627>`__ **82**, 5053 (1985). The program "
"can optimize a weighted energy average of several states, and is capable of "
"treating both completely general configuration expansions and also long "
"CASSCF expansions as described in `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(85)80025-7>`__ **115**, 259 (1985)."
msgstr ""
"多组态自洽场。这是\\ `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.448627>`__ **82**,"
" 5053 (1985)中描述的二次收敛MCSCF程序。该程序可以优化多个态的加权能量平均值，并且能够处理完全一般的组态展开以及\\ `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(85)80025-7>`__ **115**, "
"259 (1985)中描述的长CASSCF展开。"

msgid ""
"Multireference perturbation theory (MRPT2, CASPT2, CASPT3), including "
"(extended) multi-state methods MS-CASPT2 and XMS-CASPT2 as described in "
"`Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/002689796173967>`__ **89**, 645 "
"(1996), `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, "
"5546 (2000), `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ "
"**135**, 081106 (2011)."
msgstr ""
"多参考微扰理论（MRPT2, CASPT2, CASPT3），包括（扩展的）多态方法MS-CASPT2和XMS-CASPT2，如\\ `Mol. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/002689796173967>`__ **89**, 645 (1996)、\\ "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, 5546 "
"(2000)、\\ `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ **135**,"
" 081106 (2011)中所述。"

msgid ""
"Multireference CI. As well as the usual single reference function approaches"
" (MP2, SDCI, CEPA), this module implements the internally contracted "
"multireference CI method as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.455556>`__ **89**, 5803 (1988) and `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(88)87412-8>`__ **145**, "
"514 (1988). Non variational variants (e.g. MR-ACPF), as described in Theor. "
"Chim. Acta 78 (1990) 175, are also available. Electronically excited states "
"can be computed as described in Theor. Chim. Acta, **84** 95 (1992). A new "
"more efficient MRCI implementation is described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3609809>`__ **135**, 054101 (2011)."
msgstr ""
"多参考CI。除了通常的单参考函数方法（MP2, SDCI, CEPA）外，该模块还实现了内收缩多参考CI方法，如\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.455556>`__ **89**, 5803 (1988)和\\ `Chem. Phys."
" Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(88)87412-8>`__ **145**, 514 "
"(1988)中所述。非变分变体（例如MR-ACPF），如Theor. Chim. Acta 78 (1990) "
"175中所述，也可用。电子激发态的计算如Theor. Chim. Acta, **84** 95 (1992)中所述。一种新的更高效的MRCI实现在\\"
" `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3609809>`__ **135**, 054101 "
"(2011)中描述。"

msgid ""
"Møller-Plesset perturbation theory (MPPT), Coupled-Cluster (CCSD), Quadratic"
" configuration interaction (QCISD), and Brueckner Coupled-Cluster (BCCD) for"
" closed shell systems, as described in `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(92)86093-W>`__ **190**, 1 (1992). "
"Perturbative corrections for triple excitations can also be calculated "
"(`Chem. Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ "
"**227**, 321 (1994))."
msgstr ""
"闭壳层系统的Møller-"
"Plesset微扰理论（MPPT）、耦合簇（CCSD）、二次组态相互作用（QCISD）和Brueckner耦合簇（BCCD），如\\ `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(92)86093-W>`__ **190**, 1 "
"(1992)中所述。三重激发的微扰修正也可以计算（\\ `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ **227**, 321 (1994)）。"

msgid ""
"Open-shell coupled cluster theories as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465990>`__ **99**, 5219 (1993), `Chem. Phys. "
"Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ **227**, 321 "
"(1994)."
msgstr ""
"开壳层耦合簇理论，如\\ `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465990>`__ "
"**99**, 5219 (1993)、\\ `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ **227**, 321 (1994)中所述。"

msgid ""
"An interface to the MRCC program of M. Kallay, allowing coupled-cluster "
"calculations with arbitrary excitation level."
msgstr "与M. Kallay的MRCC程序的接口，允许进行任意激发能级的耦合簇计算。"

msgid ""
"Full Configuration Interaction. This is the determinant based benchmarking "
"program described in Comp. Phys. Commun. 54 (1989) 75."
msgstr "完全组态相互作用。这是Comp. Phys. Commun. 54 (1989) 75中描述的基于行列式的基准测试程序。"

msgid ""
"Analytical energy gradients for SCF, DFT, state-averaged MCSCF/CASSCF, "
"MRPT2/CASPT2, MP2, QCISD(T), and CCSD(T) methods."
msgstr ""
"用于 SCF、DFT、态平均 MCSCF/CASSCF、MRPT2/CASPT2、MP2、QCISD(T) 和 CCSD(T) 方法的解析能量梯度。"

msgid "Analytical non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements for MCSCF."
msgstr "用于 MCSCF 的解析非绝热耦合矩阵元。"

msgid ""
"One-electron transition properties for MCSCF, MRCI, and EOM-CCSD "
"wavefunctions, CASSCF and MRCI transition properties also between "
"wavefunctions with different orbitals, as described in `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701326978>`__ **105**, 1239, (2007)."
msgstr ""
"用于 MCSCF、MRCI 和 EOM-CCSD 波函数的单电子跃迁性质，以及在不同轨道波函数之间的 CASSCF 和 MRCI 跃迁性质，如 "
"`Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701326978>`__ **105**, 1239,"
" (2007) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"Spin-orbit coupling, as described in `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970009483386>`__ **98**, 1823 (2000). More "
"recently, a new spin-orbit integral program for generally contracted basis "
"sets has been implemented."
msgstr ""
"自旋-轨道耦合，如 `Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970009483386>`__ "
"**98**, 1823 (2000) 中所述。最近，已实现了一个用于广义收缩基组的新自旋-轨道积分程序。"

msgid ""
"Douglas-Kroll-Hess Hamiltonian up to arbitrary order and the "
"eXact-2-Component (X2C) Hamiltonian."
msgstr "Douglas-Kroll-Hess 哈密顿量（可达任意阶）和精确二分量 (X2C) 哈密顿量。"

msgid ""
"Density-functional theory symmetry-adapted intermolecular perturbation "
"theory (with density fitting), DFT-SAPT , as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1824898>`__ **122**, 014103 (2005)."
msgstr ""
"密度泛函理论对称性适应分子间微扰理论（含密度拟合），DFT-SAPT，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1824898>`__ **122**, 014103 (2005) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"Some two-electron transition properties for MCSCF wavefunctions (e.g., "
":math:`L_x^2` etc.)."
msgstr "MCSCF 波函数的一些双电子跃迁性质（例如，\\ :math:`L_x^2` 等）。"

msgid "Mulliken population analysis and Natural Population Analysis (NPA)"
msgstr "Mulliken 布居分析和自然布居分析（NPA）"

msgid "Orbital localization."
msgstr "轨道定域化。"

msgid "Natural bond orbitals (NBOs)."
msgstr "自然键轨道（NBO）。"

msgid "Distributed Multipole Analysis (A. J. Stone)."
msgstr "分布多极分析（A. J. Stone）。"

msgid ""
"Automatic geometry optimization as described in J. Comp. Chem. **18**, "
"(1997), 1473. Constrained optimization is also possible."
msgstr "自动几何优化，如 J. Comp. Chem. **18**, (1997), 1473 所述。约束优化也是可能的。"

msgid ""
"Automatic calculation of vibrational frequencies, intensities, and "
"thermodynamic properties."
msgstr "自动计算振动频率、强度和热力学性质。"

msgid ""
"Reaction path following, as described in Theor. Chem. Acc. **100**, (1998), "
"21."
msgstr "反应路径跟踪，如 Theor. Chem. Acc. **100**, (1998), 21 所述。"

msgid ""
"Efficient facilities to treat large lattices of point charges for QM/MM "
"calculations, including lattice gradients."
msgstr "用于 QM/MM 计算的处理大点电荷晶格的高效工具，包括晶格梯度。"

msgid ""
"Various utilities allowing other more general optimizations, looping and "
"branching (e.g., for automatic generation of complete potential energy "
"surfaces), general housekeeping operations."
msgstr "用于其他更通用优化、循环和分支（例如，用于自动生成完整势能面）以及通用内务操作的各种实用程序。"

msgid ""
"Geometry output in XYZ, `MOLDEN <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ and "
"`Gaussian <http://www.gaussian.com>`__ formats; molecular orbital and "
"frequency output in `MOLDEN <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ format."
msgstr ""
"几何结构输出为 XYZ、\\ `MOLDEN <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ 和 `Gaussian "
"<http://www.gaussian.com>`__ 格式；分子轨道和频率输出为 `MOLDEN "
"<https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ 格式。"

msgid ""
"Integral-direct implementation of all Hartree-Fock, DFT and pair-correlated "
"methods (MP, CCSD, MRCI etc.), as described in Mol. Phys., **96**, (1999), "
"719. At present, perturbative triple excitation methods are not implemented."
msgstr ""
"所有 Hartree-Fock、DFT 和成对相关方法（MP、CCSD、MRCI 等）的积分直接实现，如 Mol. Phys., **96**, "
"(1999), 719 所述。目前，微扰三重激发方法尚未实现。"

